\"素净\"一致）\n· 画面构图：单人 3D 角色定妆照，半身 / 胸像，简约纯色背景（浅灰），柔光打面，重点刻画面部细节、真丝与羊绒的材质质感；4K 超高清；禁止文字 / 水印 / 多余装饰"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "提示词"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#355", "size": [718.394775390625, 289.5167236328125], "pos": [101.75931549072266, -2310.928466796875], "id": 456, "properties": {"cnr_id": "ComfyUI_Comfyroll_CustomNodes", "ver": "unknown", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"prompt": true}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 11}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [45117], "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [270, 130], "color": "rgba(38, 73, 116, 0.7)", "pos": [196.77252197265625, -1568.740966796875], "widgets_values": ["", "", "", ""], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text_1"}, "name": "text_1", "link": 45115, "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本_1"}, {"widget": {"name": "text_2"}, "shape": 7, "name": "text_2", "link": 45116, "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本_2"}, {"widget": {"name": "text_3"}, "shape": 7, "name": "text_3", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本_3"}, {"widget": {"name": "text_4"}, "shape": 7, "name": "text_4", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本_4"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "id": 510, "type": "LayerUtility: TextJoin", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LayerUtility: TextJoin"}, "order": 19}, {"outputs": [{"name": "prompt", "links": [45116], "label": "提示词文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"name": "show_help", "links": [], "label": "show_help", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "color": "#9cd4b4", "widgets_values": ["采用并排分屏构图方式，画面从左至右严格划分为四个独立面板：第一面板为角色面部精细特写肖像；第二面板为正面全身站立姿势；第三面板为侧面全身站立姿势；第四面板为背面全身站立姿势（背部清晰可见）。所有面板统一采用中性浅灰色或米白色工作室背景，照明均匀柔和，模拟专业摄影棚布光，无强烈阴影或色温差异。四个视图中头身比例、肢体长度、服装细节及褶皱走向必须